.nh
.TH containers-storage-remove-names 1 "January 2023"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
containers-storage-remove-names \- Remove names from a layer/image/container

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBcontainers-storage\fP \fBremove-names\fP [\fIoptions\fP [...]] \fIlayerOrImageOrContainerNameOrID\fP

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
In addition to IDs, \fIlayers\fP, \fIimages\fP, and \fIcontainers\fP can have
human-readable names assigned to them in \fIcontainers-storage\fP\&.  The \fIremove-names\fP
command can be used to remove one or more names from them.

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-n | --name\fP \fIname\fP

.PP
Specifies a name to remove from the layer, image, or container.

.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
containers-storage remove-names -n my-for-realsies-awesome-container f3be6c6134d0d980936b4c894f1613b69a62b79588fdeda744d0be3693bde8ec
.EE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
containers-storage-add-names(1)
containers-storage-get-names(1)
containers-storage-set-names(1)
